# --- secrets. NEVER commit these. -------------------------------------
# A key pushed to a public repo is scraped by bots within hours. If one
# ever does get committed, rotating the key in the Sarvam dashboard is the
# only real fix — deleting the commit is not enough, it stays in history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
secrets.json

# --- Raw DDXPlus release — 808 MB unpacked. ---------------------------
# Re-download from Figshare (see README). counts.npz IS committed;
# the demo machine must never rebuild from the raw CSVs.
ddxplus/
release_train_patients.zip
release_validate_patients.zip
release_test_patients.zip

